      "content": "idk i just feel like doctors always overreact and make everything sound way scarier than it is. i'm taking a super low dose of the pill anyway and i've been doing fine for years. if i just take the st johns wort at a different time of day like in the morning and take my pill at night, wouldn't that solve the problem? it seems like a lot of work to make an appointment just for a plant.",
